{"availability":"available","full":"karuqii9704/carecanvas","name":"carecanvas","description":"Human-gated, traceable AI illustration pipeline with deterministic demo and env-gated Claude, fal.ai, Supabase, and Inngest adapters.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-20T07:19:37Z","updated":"2026-10-08T01:42:43Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://carecanvas.vercel.app/","topics":["ai-agents","fal-ai","human-in-the-loop","inngest","nextjs","supabase","typescript"],"demo":"https://carecanvas.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.221Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.221Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.221Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.221Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["CareCanvas is a human-gated AI illustration pipeline for health, wellbeing, and children's teams. It demonstrates how a small multi-agent workflow can be inspectable, cost-bounded, and safe by construction instead of hiding everything behind one prompt.","The public application runs in deterministic demo mode by default. It needs no account, API key, external request, or paid generation. A separate harness profile can exercise either Gemini or Anthropic for the three intelligence stages while keeping image generation deterministic. Durable live mode remains an explicit, fully configured opt-in.","Current verification boundary: the Gemini adapter and acceptance harness are implemented, but no Gemini key is configured in this workspace or public deployment. The Gemini path has therefore not yet been live-tested against Google's API. Demo results are deterministic and must not be described as Gemini, Claude, or Flux output."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karuqii9704/carecanvas/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f7095f634c87ab849c3b28c88a76160e268f4e4d42cda86ab6d244ef76a09bb3","extractedAt":"2026-10-1